{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 42, :comments ["<b>Esav her elder son.</b> The verse says ״the elder״ to indicate that he is capable of carrying out what he plotted to do to his brother. ״Her younger son״ means on account of his being lesser than him in ability." "<b>Comforts himself concerning you.</b> Meaning, he receives consolation over what you did to him — to kill you — and thereby the birthright and the blessing will revert to him."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:44:03.524937767Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}